cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the dataset it produces, please cite both."
title: "Bioclimatic and seasonal climate variables for Europe under eight SSP-RCP pathways: pipeline code"
abstract: >-
  Delta-change downscaling of IPSL-CM6A-LR monthly fields onto the CHELSA V2.1
  baseline climatology, producing 19 WorldClim bioclimatic variables and 8
  seasonal Ricardian covariates at 30 arc-seconds for a 1981-2010 baseline and
  eight SSP-RCP pathways across three future periods, with aggregation to 1,345
  NUTS3 regions.
type: software
